 pericoli esterni inclusa l'invasione degli umani nel suo regno. Un giorno dovrà affrontare una scelta impossibile: scegliere tra l'amore e il suo dovere da guardiana del Cuore della Foresta. Riuscirà a farsi amare dal talentuoso giovane musicista Lucas e proteggere il suo regno?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Mavka: The Forest Song","overview":"Mavka, a Soul of the Forest, faces an impossible choice between love and her duty as Guardian of the Heart of the Forest when she falls for a human, a talented young musician named Lukas."},{"language":"uk-UK","overview":"Безмежні українські ліси з давніх-давен приховують безліч таємниць і загадок. Тут, серед столітніх дерев, живуть незвичайні міфічні істоти, а серед них — Мавка, Душа й новообрана Берегиня Лісу. Її головне покликання — захищати Ліс і його головний скарб — Джерело життя — від будь-яких зазіхань людей."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTXZASZ7bdNiJLkd6Btb3JRErlz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lyHmhoRj3zXSdeCYbs2oOXLCF4K.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":459003,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"uk-UK","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTXZASZ7bdNiJLkd6Btb3JRErlz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pTXZASZ7bdNiJLkd6Btb3JRErlz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTXZASZ7bdNiJLkd6Btb3JRErlz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pTXZASZ7bdNiJLkd6Btb3JRErlz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xC2npxbeAsBKipDyIh2l0z6i0Jg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xC2npxbeAsBKipDyIh2l0z6i0Jg.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/or